 */

entries./**\n * Subtract register and an immedi:
/**
 *  寄存器减去立即数：dest = src - imm
 */

entries./**\n * Logical AND register and an imme:
/**
 * 寄存器与立即数按位逻辑与：dest = src & imm
 */

entries./**\n * Logical OR register and an immed:
/**
 * 寄存器与立即数按位逻辑或：dest = src | imm
 */

entries./**\n * Copy an immediate value into reg:
/**
 * 将立即数复制到寄存器中：dest = imm
 */

entries./**\n * Logical shift left register valu:
/**
 * 将寄存器值按立即数逻辑左移：dest = src << imm
 */

entries./**\n * Logical shift right register val:
/**
 * 将寄存器值按立即数逻辑右移：dest = val >> imm
 */

entries./**\n * Increment stage_cnt register by:
/**
 * 将 stage_cnt 寄存器值增加一个立即数：stage_cnt = stage_cnt + imm
 */

entries./**\n * Decrement stage_cnt register by:
/**
 * 将 stage_cnt 寄存器值减少一个立即数：stage_cnt = stage_cnt - imm
 */

entries./**\n * Reset stage_cnt register by an i:
/**
 * 通过立即数清零复位 stage_cnt 寄存器：stage_cnt = 0
 */

